{"articleNo":"378015","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=378015&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[장학] 2022년 한국우편사업진흥원 포커스온 우정사회봉사단 3기 장학생 모집 공고","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2022.06.20","hit":"15930","attachments":[{"name":"2022년 한국우편사업진흥원 포커스온 우정사회봉사단 3기 장학생 모집 공고.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=378015&attachNo=113406"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\"><b>2022년 한국우편사업진흥원 포커스온 우정사회봉사단 3기 장학생 모집 공고</b></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">한국우편사업진흥원은 포커스온 우정사회봉사단은 편지</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">우표\n등을 활용하여 문화소외계층 학생들과 우정문화의 따뜻한 온기를 나누는 봉사단으로</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">대학생팀이 자신들의\n독창적인 아이디어로 직접 기획 및 컨택하여 활동하는 봉사 장학금입니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">.</span></p><p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\"><br></span></p><p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">1. 선발대상 : 2022년 2학기 재학예정인 대학생</span></p><p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp; - 기준학기 휴학 및 졸업, 졸업유예생은 제외</span></p><p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp; - 자격 미달시(2022-2학기 휴학, 졸업유예, 졸업 등) 장학금 지급, 이월, 양도 없음</span></p><p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">2.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">선발인원</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\"> </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">총 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">175</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">명 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">매월 팀별 활동비 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">10</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">만원 지급</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"word-break: keep-all; vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">3.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">장학금액</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\"> </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">: 1</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">인당 장학금 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">100</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">만원 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">( 50</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">명 선발</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"word-break: keep-all; vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">4.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">신청기간</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\"> </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">: </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">~ 2022</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">년 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">6</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">월 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">28</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">일</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">화</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">) 24:00</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">까지</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"word-break: keep-all; vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">5.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">신청방법</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\"> </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">지원서 작성후</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">이메일제출&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">letter@posa.or.kr(제출서류 첨부파일 참고)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"word-break: keep-all; vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">6.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">문의</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">: 02-967-0528(</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">카카오톡 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">드림스폰 카카오톡 채널,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, Appl